Subject: [PATCH] Share pure GLSL math semantics for coordinate placement and uniformity

Recognize arithmetic by instruction-set import, preserve module dependencies,
and keep pure math loop bounds uniform. Do not speculate pointer-output or
interpolation operations. Test multi-entry placement and varying loop rejection.

